# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Application functions for optimization {#application-functions-for-optimization}"
msgstr "Application functions untuk pengoptimuman {#application-functions-for-optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following quantum functions package the full optimization workflow, from problem mapping through hardware execution and post-processing, behind a managed interface. Rather than building and tuning your own circuits, you provide a problem definition, such as an objective function, a graph, or an industry-specific input like asset price data, and the function returns an optimized solution. These functions address optimization problems across domains, including unconstrained and constrained binary optimization, portfolio rebalancing in finance, and resource allocation problems defined on graphs.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi kuantum berikut membungkus keseluruhan aliran kerja pengoptimuman, daripada pemetaan masalah melalui pelaksanaan pada perkakasan hingga pascapemprosesan, di sebalik antara muka terurus. Daripada membina dan menala litar sendiri, anda menyediakan takrifan masalah, seperti fungsi objektif, graf, atau input khusus industri seperti data harga aset, dan fungsi ini memulangkan penyelesaian yang dioptimumkan. Fungsi ini menangani masalah pengoptimuman merentas pelbagai domain, termasuk pengoptimuman binari tanpa kekangan dan berkekangan, pengimbangan semula portfolio dalam kewangan, dan masalah peruntukan sumber yang ditakrifkan pada graf.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"IBM Quantum&reg; Functions are a beta feature available only to IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (through the IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users. Refer to [Set up IBM Quantum Functions](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) for instructions on getting access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"IBM Quantum&reg; Functions ialah ciri beta yang hanya tersedia untuk pengguna Pelan Premium IBM Quantum, Pelan Flex, dan Pelan On-Prem (melalui API IBM Quantum Platform). Rujuk [Sediakan IBM Quantum Functions](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) untuk arahan mendapatkan akses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

